              "# Trump escalates trade war with China and threatens ANOTHER $100 billion in tariffs after Beijing hits American soy and airplanes with tit-for-tat levies\n- **Trump announced $50 billion in tariffs on Chinese imports Tuesday, drawing an equivalent retaliation from Beijing**\n- **Now he's adding another $100 billion in tariff threats to the equation, noting that China had targeted U.S. agriculture**\n- **White House is playing a long game, assuming Chinese business needs U.S. markets more than Americas need to sell into China**",
